# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong: "Do this only once each turn" counts a card cast, not a look (CR 603.2h; the ruling: "Once
# you choose to cast the top card of your library, Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong's ability won't trigger again that turn").
# Bot1 puts the Planetarium out on turn 1 with Sol Ring, Black Lotus and Mox Jet, activates it with Mox Pearl and scries
# 2, keeping Misshapen Fiend on top and putting Island on the bottom. The trigger looks at the Fiend and Bot1 declines to
# cast it. Then Meticulous Archive enters and surveils 1, keeping the Fiend: the Planetarium triggers again, since nothing
# was cast with it yet, and this time Bot1 casts the Fiend free. The Fiend was looked at twice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong
Meticulous Archive
Mox Pearl
Misshapen Fiend
Island
Counterspell x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

